Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
*.tmp
~$*

# NOTE: output/*.pdf is deliberately NOT ignored.
# It is derived and regenerable, but it is also the artefact that leaves the project and
# lands in somebody's inbox. For an intelligence product the question "what exactly did we
# publish, and when" has to be answerable, so the published PDF is tracked on purpose.
